{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>ויהי</b> — The sense is that he was in Babylon until year one of King Cyrus. Had it been written עד שנה אחת, it would appear that a full year had elapsed; but in saying שנת אחת, the sense is within the year."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:59.247162265Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}